  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06636fd48ee0a8bc584e45a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次的竞赛，有令你感到不安的要素吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2e0363d1b0616fd641af78dd0e863d213e62d98f5f92ee99c243f3fd015654",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1851ffb8503d3c1e99f9d30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有做什么事祈求好运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e37f432d02ff939eccdce4da382f034142b2754134b534240d3a8a167a5a8b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf5e964a872619cf8d5b81b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "兼顾学生会与竞赛最让你感到辛苦的是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "342004631ee2aab7010600f120a9124cb1dc42ed6f86b0a08525b65e6fbbaf36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e184d1e9b6cdc421641604",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有只鸟一直在你头上盘旋呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a43fc1d9d1985bb0eae7cedcdb0a453f6aa4c499b4b7015f84b04ce9cb8b0b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b082d48a596d69684379d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们不会紧张的诀窍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59732d13f75b8d0e7fc6f69c9885498df4f4e48c077afad712c87913d5ea4185",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72dcc088935d6de3736c596d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对于本次战场的局势，你有何看法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f5d82d980377ff277a0274f03b13bde173f184012a5666000c7c1989f168d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273753a75db63624ec18c09b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在今天的竞赛当中，你最关注谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "730c865d805b9fa91a94a23df87e73266018693e5afd8a4a16048a040d6f0c62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95b52dba087ecd7e8e4097d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你觉得获得胜利的关键是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6f0f6923974db5a4ee56377b83affcaa6889a878fe6abbf9aed76532e60449",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "423"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37549d37025652a27958d6f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近的钓鱼成果如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0cd6ded6970e05862f031de7fb4e1298f395bd3ab1ec4fbc5129af2ec8bb9fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d69275ef2f5d3f981d63dd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟你要好的猫咪过得还好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaae4f30d4c4a5db10801f122cbfb06cd85f9574aa075883038e16af9eab7f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445e2dab8ab2d4efe25746bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们胜利的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "101ef869ca1844732c0caef7d06b423da699e8c32dcff4849b9677c43475577e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b9ff7f2d8686c16352ab9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛中会期待什么样的发展？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6f21dd6f582fb5f4fee8f042cda84b3371637acfc3fe3e43ffd680d88d1ddd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "427"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e24c8147d0a9edb033dd18e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "到目前为止做过最辛苦的训练是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "decad934505ae29b9577efbedff19860a519088133afb3cd025a638308ec3b1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "428"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5ed6a4ce4731ba80230bd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待你展现如闪电般一鸣惊人的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "732d8bd1a0ed2de4a20d055d51c89977f8c5862813835be1a79a548061b398c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "429"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4768864293bfc7c66734ce18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对竞争对手们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a33aa43de0b4c1a16896ff2b811a35f8906cdb32171890bfa12632e3a687cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203347e8fb53f62aaaaa7206",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你对今天竞赛的期许。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dff7582ada1fd2dd53d406300cb564867ca0169783bc55164aac2300dca5186",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "430"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bed7c9f6a779637410fa57b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "日本的竞赛感觉如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4592bfee947a946d862619ace242a4132ffa4a58039d19082f1809a5af8f3984",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01a6b87286d6c2df2cbd11e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你很喜欢拉面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86698c4c5ac8be31a802ab3649d99d2ce4b1e1ea542309c1447d6447faa924c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f88de9721d32aa0ad9847c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对眼镜有什么坚持吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6124be2be639041e168070b689222f9e318b97b2df4e6fa46263dc85bbc06b8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "433"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c91330a211ba821fc60abeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对BNW的那2人有什么看法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da39ae64643e7b4bdc697865623ba9e69dc305ec99a9f8598d9b0bb8a9e0f6bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "434"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9f0a46b1ec99c241113d524",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有特别努力克服的课题吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "586188be76723cd96e4ed56fe170cc6f9700944d540863bed3cf90f509e27da1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "435"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3be5a800adff345ae7b939",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7321329fe7053537673a27efce5d83991630f035a40f049626407139a041be58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "436"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:903b62bc151db735958d3afa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通往第1名的视野如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "739624bf7c6b312f4505b4842094d3ae5e9f1d3e73760435d03605d6a3f2aec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "437"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad0f803dc69014672cfec8c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有特别留意的参赛者吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa5f67a56a888cf6138478ac3a27ad0b51cc718c4c23e22cd92a1b61f7468d07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "438"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd74c30efbeeda8424cd183b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "直白地说，目前最关注的对手是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc6a9dba88ba529b10a7504def7f19afb2235c8515b2f727913ecc844c07492",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "439"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b830ad49883efeab050718",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得最辛苦的训练是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bc033852587690846b8662d86cbfac3c299beeeb9fd773b53a23a0123e3eff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4873d2db76bdaefe3f0fcf4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喜欢的咖啡是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04056be011b45f3e7e7d2f6c44035f4acd90dfdae1cc2b781a63d93d126dccfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "440"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:515a71b5140ec6040214daaf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "平常都是怎么度过假日的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "564c6298ce1b93b2d899ac9a883b0baf56f3d0a6d2c70f46df09deb48c3613ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a3591444af41c0a99fac51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛前的致胜料理吃了什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "977ce0c7615a51c57dff528bc9bedf1dc33650d36215b553d98df2851f2f32aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc94527b581ae22e702d1fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有竞赛和训练的日子都怎么度过？",
      "source_fingerprint": "983491826807b4f382b0c40de8281498dea0c3870d05ec066c4325f8f0c6a58a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "443"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:797fb119aeee45560d66007d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今感到最热血沸腾的竞赛是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7e5fd43bb9a57674ad873f748b504264a75b773811f6f62ec5958cc2be240b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "444"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf39ce2fac70bb5a502d1c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛时最重要的是哪个部位的肌肉呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d388aed9292f96062256e5696e450ee426e54af9321bc0ab07bcaa2e4faa8ab5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "445"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a1741e06e80b3bbd1989fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想放松的时候都做些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfdcfe562460edcd75afe8527449dc6a29ceea048e62872adf9bfa1dfc026403",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "446"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48dfff4a165f29f1842f138d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为目白家的赛马娘，会感觉到压力沉重吗？",
